"\n"
"You might be thinking that since this is a whole new type you're have to prove all the theorems from Space World again. But worry not, we've done it for you, including porting over §3.\n"
"\n"
"Just like how §4 carries a §5, §6 carries a §7 but we'll see that later. Firstly we'll give bilinear products their rightful place in spacetime by defining a Minkowski Product, if you're interested in learning about why Minkowski keeps popping up don't be afraid to look him up! Pretty interesting guy."
